                      %mi x
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} K:\prod_{x:A} H(f(x)) =_{f(g(f(x)) =_{B} f(x)} \mathrm{ap}_f(f(g(x)), x, G(x))
                expressing the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coherence+law"} coherence law
                for equivalences, where
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} ap
