                  %mi x
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x:\mathbb{I} \vdash C(x)
            indexed by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interval+type"} interval type
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
